    "text": {
     "en": "We can make symmetrical shapes by folding paper, cutting and opening, by inkblots and by drawing on a grid with a mirror line.\nIn reflection symmetry each point has a matching point at the same distance on the other side of the mirror line.\nSymmetry appears in leaves, butterflies, logos and rangoli."
    }
